		{
			description: [
				"&f欢迎来到&6&l圣诞烹饪与装饰&r&f，一款通过添加全球各地的&6&l圣诞菜肴&r&f和各式各样的精美&6&l圣诞装饰&r&f来增强你游戏体验的顶级模组。"
				""
				"&fThis mod provides robust utility, as all items and blocks are craftable using in-game vanilla resources, ensuring ease of integration into any survival world. You can create functional &6&lChristmas Presents&r&f in multiple colors and two sizes, which feature a unique interior for storage, and build highly flexible and customizable &6&lChristmas Trees&r&f. Start decorating and enjoying the finest holiday cuisine now."
			]
